# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the vendored Node.js tests (QJSNAPI_SANITIZE).
#
# Only memory that a Node.js test leaks by design, in addon code, belongs
# here. References and async work items the addon never deletes are freed
# with the env (qn_env_free_orphan_refs, qn_env_free_works), so they need no
# entry; Node.js leaks them.

# node-api/test_env_teardown_gc/binding.c: MyObject_fini runs at teardown,
# when JavaScript can no longer run; napi_get_named_property fails (as in
# Node.js) and NODE_API_CALL_RETURN_VOID returns before freeing the
# malloc'ed MyObject.
leak:test_env_teardown_gc/binding.c
